      "content": "\"a cessation of effort\"... that's an interesting way to put it. like you're saying the struggle itself is the problem? i've spent my whole life trying to optimize, trying to create order out of chaos, but maybe i'm just fighting a losing battle against the way things are supposed to be. you make it sound like there's a certain logic to just... stopping.",
